# D19 in the Rust slice: the repository root's `[Bb]in/` rule (meant for .NET
# build output, which is exactly what this directory has) silently excluded
# every measurement binary in that slice, so its logs were committed and the
# code that produced them was not. A figure whose harness is not in the tree
# cannot be defended (R4), so the rule is re-included here for SOURCES and left
# in place for build output.
bin/
obj/
!src/**/*.cs
!gen/**/*.py
__pycache__/
bin-floor/
obj-floor/
abi/target/
bin-strict/
obj-strict/
target-core/
target-core-count/
